                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Brownsville resident, Alix Flores, relies on ACA health coverage to manage a chronic health conditions he\u2019s had for more than 30 years. Without coverage, he will be faced to pay $1,000 out of pocket for medications.\n\nNo one should ever pay this much for life-saving medication. The 130,000 people in South Texas facing the same reality are exactly why I keep fighting to extend the Affordable Care Act Tax Credits.\nhttps://t.co/JRzlNYw9Cy",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
