                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Without the Affordable Care Act tax credits, health care premiums will surge and more people will go uninsured. \n\nOur region already has one of the highest uninsured rates in the nation, which is why I\u2019ll stop at nothing to ensure South Texans have affordable health care. https://t.co/tlXcY24R6t",
