                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This Administration promised to lower costs, yet prices on everything from groceries to utilities are rising. So much so, that Texans have paid an additional $339 this year due to Republican\u2019s reckless policies.\n\nI wont stop fighting to lower your costs and make health care more affordable. South Texans shouldn\u2019t have to break the bank to make ends meet.",
