                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "We need to talk about health care because this administration has created a crisis for hundreds of thousands of South Texans and isn\u2019t doing a damn thing to fix it.\n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m supporting a discharge petition to force a House vote on extending ACA tax credits for three more years.",
