                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans would rather gift Argentina a $40 billion bailout and prioritize tax breaks for the ultra-wealthy than lower costs for families and address the health care crisis many South Texans are facing.\n\nAmericans are feeling the pain of Republican inaction. https://t.co/PR5nggrJbj",
