                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "It's unconscionable that nearly 50,000 South Texas veterans, including 24,000 with service-connected disabilities, are forced to travel 300 miles to go to the closest VA Medical Center.\n\nI proudly testified before the @HouseVetAffairs to urge for the immediate construction of a VA Medical Center in South Texas, because we must provide our military heroes in the Coastal Bend and Rio Grande Valley the accessible health care they earned!",
