                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Between Republicans \"Big, Ugly Bill\" and failure to extend ACA tax credits, the American health care system will lose over $1 TRILLION.\n\nIf ACA tax credits are allowed to expire at the end of this month, many people won\u2019t just face higher costs\u2014they\u2019ll lose their coverage entirely.\n\nThe result? These cuts will lead to closures of rural hospitals and health centers across South Texas leaving our friends and neighbors sicker and poorer.",
