                "text": "Nearly 142,000 of our neighbors in TX-34 use Affordable Care Act tax credits as a lifeline for routine doctor visits, cancer treatments, and medications. Republicans' failure to extend these credits by the end of the year is the same as them turning a blind eye to your health and wellbeing.\nhttps://t.co/kESn5gl6Zg",
