                "text": "While South Texans struggle with inflated grocery costs and skyrocketing health care prices, Republicans enacted the largest cut to SNAP  in American history.\n\nIt's cruel and I won't stand for it. As I told my colleagues on the @HouseAgDems, I'm ready to work across the aisle to correct this wrong imposed by the Republicans' \"Big, Bad Bill.\"",
