                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "What a disappointing decision by House Republican leadership, which will result in health insurance premiums skyrocketing for nearly 142,000 South Texans.\n\nWe had bipartisan support to extend ACA tax credits, but once again, the Republicans in charge of what legislation Congress votes on refuse to do the right thing.\nhttps://t.co/tMYZLbzp8Y",
