                "text": "Four House Republicans finally built up the courage to break rank and join every Democrat to force a vote on extending ACA tax credits for three more years.\n\nHealth insurance premiums are set to skyrocket at the end of the month. Congressional action cannot wait; South Texans need immediate relief.\nhttps://t.co/syRRKJls5H",
