                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "When the \"Big, Ugly Bill\" passed without ACA tax credits, expert researchers assessed tens of thousands of Americans would die annually because they could no longer afford health care.\n\nIn the richest country in the world, South Texans shouldn't have to travel to Mexico for cheaper care. There is bipartisan support to extend ACA tax credits for three more years, but Republican leadership continues to delay congressional action.",
